      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "source_quote": "阮韜字長明，陳留人，晉金紫光祿大夫裕玄孫也。",
      "reading": "阮韜字長明，籍陳留，晉金紫光祿大夫阮裕的玄孫，祖孫相隔四代。",
      "note": "阮韜字長明，籍陳留，晉金紫光祿大夫阮裕的玄孫，祖孫相隔四代。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-92-22-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 59,
      "source_quote": "韜少歷清官，爲南兖州別駕，刺史江夏王劉義恭逆求資費錢，韜曰：「此朝廷物。」",
      "reading": "歷清官，任南兖州別駕。刺史江夏王劉義恭索預支資費，他答是朝廷物。",
      "note": "歷清官，任南兖州別駕。刺史江夏王劉義恭索預支資費，他答是朝廷物。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-92-59-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092",
      "start_codepoint": 59,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "source_quote": "執不與。",
      "reading": "執不給付，主語仍是阮韜。",
      "note": "執不給付，主語仍是阮韜。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "source_quote": "宋孝武選侍中四人，竝以風貌。",
      "reading": "宋孝武帝據風貌選取四名侍中。",
      "note": "宋孝武帝據風貌選取四名侍中。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-14-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "source_quote": "王彧、謝莊爲一雙，韜與何偃爲一雙。",
      "reading": "王彧、謝莊一雙，阮韜、何偃一雙，為選官配列。",
      "note": "王彧、謝莊一雙，阮韜、何偃一雙，為選官配列。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-31-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 36,
      "source_quote": "常充兼假。",
      "reading": "阮韜常以兼假充職。",
      "note": "阮韜常以兼假充職。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-36-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 36,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "source_quote": "泰始末，爲征南江州長史。",
      "reading": "劉宋泰始末任征南江州長史。",
      "note": "劉宋泰始末任征南江州長史。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-48-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "source_quote": "桂陽王休範在鎮，數出行遊，韜性方峙，未嘗隨從。",
      "reading": "桂陽王劉休範鎮江州數次出遊，韜未嘗隨行。",
      "note": "桂陽王劉休範鎮江州數次出遊，韜未嘗隨行。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-71-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "source_quote": "至散騎常侍，金紫光祿大夫，領始興王師。",
      "reading": "後至散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫，兼始興王師。",
      "note": "後至散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫，兼始興王師。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qi32-tao-94-90-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "03n_n2r_8rt_***A",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 97,
      "source_quote": "永明二年，卒。",
      "reading": "齊永明二年卒，原文未報歲數。",
      "note": "齊永明二年卒，原文未報歲數。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
